ng>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dual inventory: One for collecting items and one for collecting skills!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful 2D hand drawn backgrounds and animation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique story with lots of twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilarious characters, featuring lot of fairytales icons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Funny situations and dialogues. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying and balanced puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/367e79a4363ae124244104be10176f76.poster.avif?t=1784988073\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/367e79a4363ae124244104be10176f76.webm?t=1784988073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654690/extras/367e79a4363ae124244104be10176f76.mp4?t=1784988073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
